    "original_claim": "Gibbs density minimizes the finite energy-minus-temperature-entropy functional among stated finite-energy/absolute-entropy densities.",
    "why_false": "The stated hypotheses constrain competitor p, not q. The expression at q can be undefined as infinity minus infinity and q can be outside the minimization domain.",
